OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne child and one young adult have died
OL,7,Fafter a bus crashed in eastern France,
OL,8,Flocal authorities have said.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at around 07:00
OL,11,Flocal time on Friday in the town of
OL,12,FLent, north-east of Lyon, around 34
OL,13,Fmiles (55km) from the border with
OL,14,FSwitzerland.
OL,16,FThe town's mayor Yves Cristin told
OL,17,FFrench media the bus was carrying
OL,18,Faround 70 people when it "left the road
OL,19,Fand hit a tree in the ditch".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
