OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people are in a critical
OL,7,Fcondition and a further 13 have
OL,8,Fsustained minor injuries, the
OL,9,FBourg-en-Bresse prosecutor's office
OL,10,Ftold BFMTV.
